or $n\\in Z$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{n} & ={a}_{1}\\cdot {r}^{n-1} \\\\  & =-2\\cdot (-2)^{n-1} \\\\  & =-2\\cdot (-2)^{n}\\cdot (-2)^{-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{-2}{-2}\\cdot (-2)^{n} \\\\  & =(-2)^{n}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can define our set using a constructive definition as follows:\n\n$$\nS={(-2)^{n}\\,:\\,n\\in Z}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-183771/field-1" "q-183771/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9df722a8-2db6-5bb8-a69c-b81b33037ab2"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-183771"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-183795/field-1/926942afc411ad8874c4b87551252cbe4a9c5ab0948ed2036cc019ff1a8649d0" :answer/id #uuid "08a8844b-afe7-5295-a6e8-20d3f4bc81e9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6\\cdot {4}^{n}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-183795/field-1/b061ba92c138e25b485f5f415829186b5ae4e9f44cb85b867576e7031e99f6e9" :answer/id #uuid "b0c3bb89-38f6-5ecd-9cf1-ae3c3d17857e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot {6}^{n}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-183795/field-1/34dfed5abd1013ea3a93825a776cdff0403ce24b4e3858af811378d9d8b49731" :answer/id #uuid "7d7ad3de-d95b-5aa2-818c-fe3c43fb3ffe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot {6}^{n}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-183795/field-1/d52697eb371251a971e508570968635567363562b1ba5480d78642522fa8c468" :answer/id #uuid "89dca909-4459-56ce-81fe-0af7198b64e8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot {4}^{n}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-183795/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "57ee4848-489d-5d9d-b633-bce46a69a056" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-183795/field-1/b061ba92c138e25b485f5f415829186b5ae4e9f44cb85b867576e7031e99f6e9" :answer-field/choices ["q-183795/field-1/926942afc411ad8874c4b87551252cbe4a9c5