 that generates the elements of $S.$*\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot {3}^{n}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the elements of our set\n\n$$\n…,\\,3,\\,6,\\,12,\\,24,\\,48,\\,…\n$$\n\nform a two-way infinite geometric sequence with a common ratio $r=2:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =2 \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{12}{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{24}{12} \\\\  & =⋯\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, setting  ${a}_{1}=6,$ the $n$th term ${a}_{n}$ of our sequence for $n\\in Z$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{n} & ={a}_{1}\\cdot {r}^{n-1} \\\\  & =6\\cdot {2}^{n-1} \\\\  & =6\\cdot {2}^{n}\\cdot {2}^{-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{2}\\cdot {2}^{n} \\\\  & =3\\cdot {2}^{n}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can define our set using a constructive definition as follows:\n\n$$\nS={3\\cdot {2}^{n}\\,:\\,n\\in Z}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-183328/field-1/ma-v1/856b99a30b32cde9ad3f794de2a0b8722e6fad17138b48d3a1d03facddb6caa0"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-183779/field-1/30ab724c845c65b640d273c8e51a31006a85319d78d66465e9ec1a19d391a8e5" :answer/id #uuid "5da8de41-218e-5d13-a4b1-43f4c93113a9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot {2}^{n}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-183779/field-1/b13fc4f593da59d7c9e30d20ffdcc832c6275279d834330d42708c3a88b8c1c9" :answer/id #uuid "8acc6f99-46d1-5e18-b921-c17227ede6b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{(\\frac{1}{2})}^{n}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-183779/field-1/579776c349e005b8d209b47be003eb94eb3df0caf9bb1321c0f4296636d03eb3" :answer/id #uuid "b745558a-9714-5cb7-9fa7-ca3a3b62c791" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot {4}^{n}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-183779/field-1/0b317aeb99574650d3dc402b8afd89282fd925d2406f274e9a55ea6d8a316cbb" :answer/id #uuid "b0d8a86a-268d-5bbf-85f1-834df7308400" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{4}^{n}" :db/ensure [:answer/vali